WebKit: put WebCore/platform/graphics on the include path, as GStreamerCommon.h needs under GSTREAMER_GL

With USE_GSTREAMER_GL on and ENABLE_WEBGL off, GStreamerCommon.h includes
"GraphicsTypesGL.h" (a header of typedefs, wtf only), and the WebKit,
WebProcess, NetworkProcess and GPUProcess precompiled headers, which reach
GStreamerCommon.h through WebCore's source tree, cannot find it: nothing
puts WebCore/platform/graphics on WebKit's include path in that option
set. WebCore's own objects compile it fine, because WebCore's path has the
directory (ROCKNIX fork #228, the third of three fixes on the 2.54.0 bump).

--- a/Source/WebKit/PlatformGTK.cmake
+++ b/Source/WebKit/PlatformGTK.cmake
@@ -291,6 +291,7 @@ list(APPEND WebKit_PRIVATE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES
 
 list(APPEND WebKit_PRIVATE_INCLUDE_DIRECTORIES
     "${WEBCORE_DIR}/Modules/mediastream"
+    "${WEBCORE_DIR}/platform/graphics"
     "${WEBKIT_DIR}/NetworkProcess/glib"
     "${WEBKIT_DIR}/NetworkProcess/soup"
     "${WEBKIT_DIR}/NetworkProcess/webrtc/rice"
